    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "2 The Terrace, Pill Road, Carrick on Suir is a well-maintained two-bedroom terraced home offers comfortable living in an established residential setting, making it an excellent choice for first-time buyers, those looking to downsize, or investors seeking a low-maintenance property. The take-in form highlights its good condition and convenient location close to schools and shops.\r\n\r\nInside, the accommodation is bright and practical throughout. An inviting entrance hall leads to a comfortable sitting room with laminate timber flooring, while the adjoining dining area provides a welcoming space for everyday meals and entertaining. The fitted kitchen is equipped with an electric hob and oven and offers a functional layout with direct access to the rear of the property.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are two generously sized bedrooms, each benefiting from fitted storage, creating practical and comfortable accommodation. The shower room is fully tiled and fitted with a shower, wash hand basin and WC.\r\n\r\nOne of the property's standout features is the generous outdoor sun terrace at first-floor level, offering a private outdoor space to relax, enjoy the sunshine or create an attractive seating area. Combining practical accommodation with a convenient location, this home is ready for its next owner to move in and make it their own."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Convenient location close to schools and local shops.\r\n\r\nWell-presented throughout with a move-in-ready feel.\r\n\r\nBright sitting room and separate dining area.\r\n\r\nFitted kitchen with electric hob and oven.\r\n\r\nElevated outdoor living space extending from the upper floor.\r\n\r\nFitted wardrobes in both bedrooms.\r\n\r\nFully tiled shower room.\r\n\r\nIdeal for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors."
      },
      {
